{"video_id":"jgy-015","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"concept_definition","statement":"水气病即水肿鼓胀积水；多由表证失治，水内停而成，异于自内生之饮病。","evidence_quote":"水病","start_s":45.97,"end_s":51.73,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"表证当用麻桂葛发表；误用连翘银花板蓝等，表不去则水渐停成水病。","evidence_quote":"葛根汤","start_s":57.89,"end_s":72.565,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"水病浅深：风水最浅→失治入皮水→再入正水/石水/黄汗。","evidence_quote":"风水","start_s":87.17,"end_s":104.155,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"风水脉浮、骨节疼痛恶风，外观似麻黄汤或桂枝汤证。","evidence_quote":"风水","start_s":160.78,"end_s":170.835,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"contraindication","statement":"黄汗不宜妄发汗；可用黄芪芍药桂枝苦酒汤一类。","evidence_quote":"黄汗","start_s":1918.649,"end_s":1921.229,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"formula_indication","statement":"风水/皮水常用防己黄芪汤（讲中己黄芪汤）。","evidence_quote":"己黄芪汤","start_s":5782.027,"end_s":5784.502,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"皮水失治深入为正水，可用越婢加术汤、甘草麻黄汤等。","evidence_quote":"甘草麻黄汤","start_s":6681.317,"end_s":6689.132,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-015.kp0008","video_id":"jgy-015","type":"treatment_principle","statement":"经方调阴常倚桂枝与白芍之比例；阴虚勿妄去白芍，行阳则重桂枝。","evidence_quote":"白芍","start_s":8625.701,"end_s":8641.341,"confidence":0.85}]}